<title>PHILIPPINES: First Philippine declares 25 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>First Philippine declares 25 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Philippine Holdings Corp (FPHC) has declared a 25 percent stock dividend and a 0.10 peso cash dividend, all of which will be taken out of the company's earned surplus as of June 30, 1996, a notice to the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The record date for the cash dividend has been set on September 30, 1996, while the record date for the stock dividend is yet to be fixed by the Securities and Exchange Commission, the company said.</p>
